#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:529
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_WelcomeToBattlePyramid"
msgid ""
"Where the courage of TRAINERS\n"
"is put to the test!\p"
"Welcome to the BATTLE PYRAMID!\p"
"I am your guide to\n"
"the Battle Quest.$"
msgstr ""
"考验训练家勇气的地方！\p"
"欢迎来到对战金字塔！\p"
"我是对战探险的向导。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:536
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_EmbarkOnChallenge"
msgid ""
"Have you the courage to embark on\n"
"the Battle Quest challenge?$"
msgstr "你有勇气挑战对战探险吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:540
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_AwaitFutureChallenge"
msgid "We await your challenge in the future!$"
msgstr "我们期待你今后的挑战！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:543
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_ExplainBattlePyramid"
msgid ""
"The Battle Quest is a battling\n"
"event in which you must explore\l"
"the PYRAMID and try to reach the top.\p"
"In the PYRAMID are seven floors of\n"
"mazes, all of them filled with not only\l"
"skilled TRAINERS but also wild POKéMON.\p"
"You must enter with three POKéMON,\n"
"none of them holding an item.\p"
"On your ascent, you will be provided\n"
"with a BATTLE BAG for items.\p"
"If you fail in your challenge, any item\n"
"placed in the BATTLE BAG disappears.\p"
"If you want to interrupt your\n"
"challenge, you must select “REST”\l"
"and save the game.\p"
"If you don't save before interrupting,\n"
"you will be disqualified.$"
msgstr ""
"对战探险是一项要在金字塔里\n"
"探索、努力到达顶端的\l"
"对战比赛。\p"
"金字塔里有7层迷宫，\n"
"里面不仅有厉害的训练家，\l"
"还有野生的宝可梦。\p"
"你必须带着3只\n"
"没有携带道具的宝可梦进入。\p"
"在攀登途中，我们会提供\n"
"用来装道具的对战背包。\p"
"如果挑战失败，\n"
"放在对战背包里的道具都会消失。\p"
"如果想中断挑战，\n"
"必须选择“休息”并记录游戏进度。\p"
"如果中断前没有记录，\n"
"就会被取消资格。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:562
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_WhichLevelMode"
msgid ""
"The PYRAMID offers two courses,\n"
"Level 50 and Open Level.\l"
"Which will you enter?$"
msgstr ""
"金字塔有两种赛制：\n"
"Lv.50和自由等级。\l"
"你要参加哪一种？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:567
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_SelectThreeMons"
msgid ""
"Very good. Now, please select the three\n"
"POKéMON you wish to accompany you.$"
msgstr ""
"很好。现在，请选择\n"
"要和你同行的3只宝可梦。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:571
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_NotEnoughValidMonsLvOpen"
msgid ""
"A slight problem, adventurer!\p"
"You seem to not have the three\n"
"POKéMON qualified for the challenge.\p"
"Please also remember to take all\n"
"items from your POKéMON.\p"
"EGGS{STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""
"有点小问题，冒险家！\p"
"你好像没有3只\n"
"符合挑战条件的宝可梦。\p"
"另外，请记得把宝可梦\n"
"携带的道具全部取下来。\p"
"蛋{STR_VAR_1}。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:579
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_NotEnoughValidMonsLv50"
msgid ""
"A slight problem, adventurer!\p"
"You seem to not have the three\n"
"POKéMON qualified for the challenge.\p"
"The three POKéMON must be different\n"
"and each no higher than Level 50.\p"
"Please also remember to take all\n"
"items from your POKéMON.\p"
"EGGS{STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""
"有点小问题，冒险家！\p"
"你好像没有3只\n"
"符合挑战条件的宝可梦。\p"
"这3只宝可梦必须各不相同，\n"
"而且等级都不能超过50。\p"
"另外，请记得把宝可梦\n"
"携带的道具全部取下来。\p"
"蛋{STR_VAR_1}。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:589
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_NotEnoughValidMonsEnd"
msgid ""
"When you are ready, please have\n"
"a word with me.$"
msgstr ""
"准备好以后，\n"
"请来和我说一声。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:593
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_OkayToSaveBeforeChallenge"
msgid ""
"Before you enter the BATTLE PYRAMID,\n"
"the game must be saved. Is that okay?$"
msgstr ""
"进入对战金字塔之前，\n"
"必须先记录游戏进度。可以吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:597
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_ShowYouIntoPyramid"
msgid ""
"Very good. I will now show you into\n"
"the BATTLE PYRAMID.$"
msgstr ""
"很好。现在我带你\n"
"进入对战金字塔。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:601
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_WeWillHoldBagForSafekeeping"
msgid ""
"We will hold your BAG for safekeeping,\n"
"{PLAYER}, while you are exploring.$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}，在你探险期间，\n"
"我们会替你保管背包。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:605
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_PleaseTakePreviousBattleBag"
msgid ""
"In exchange, please take this BATTLE\n"
"BAG, the one you used previously.$"
msgstr ""
"作为交换，请拿着这个\n"
"你上次用过的对战背包。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:609
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_PleaseTakeThisBattleBag"
msgid ""
"In exchange, please take this\n"
"BATTLE BAG.$"
msgstr ""
"作为交换，\n"
"请拿着这个对战背包。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:613
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_ExchangedBagForBattleBag"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} exchanged the BAG for\n"
"the BATTLE BAG.$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}用背包\n"
"换来了对战背包。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:617
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_StepOnFloorPanel"
msgid ""
"When you step on this floor panel,\n"
"you will be transported to a higher\l"
"floor in the PYRAMID.\p"
"I hope for your sake that your\n"
"quest goes safely!$"
msgstr ""
"踩上这块地板，\n"
"你就会被传送到\l"
"金字塔里更高的楼层。\p"
"祝你探险一路平安！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:624
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_DidntSaveBeforeQuittingTakeBag"
msgid ""
"A major problem, explorer!\p"
"You did not save before ending\n"
"your challenge the last time.\p"
"Consequently, your challenge has\n"
"been disqualified, I'm sorry to say.\p"
"Here is the BAG we've been holding\n"
"for you.\p"
"{PLAYER} got the BAG back.$"
msgstr ""
"出大问题了，探险家！\p"
"你上次结束挑战之前\n"
"没有记录。\p"
"因此，很遗憾，\n"
"你的挑战被取消了资格。\p"
"这是我们替你保管的背包。\p"
"{PLAYER}拿回了背包。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:634
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_YouveConqueredPyramid"
msgid ""
"Excellent to see you back!\p"
"You've conquered the PYRAMID!\n"
"How splendid!$"
msgstr ""
"看到你回来真是太好了！\p"
"你征服了金字塔！\n"
"真是了不起！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:639
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_MonHoldingItemCannotTake"
msgid ""
"Ah, a slight problem.\p"
"At least one POKéMON is holding\n"
"an item.\p"
"I'm sorry to say, items obtained in\n"
"the PYRAMID cannot be taken away.$"
msgstr ""
"啊，有点小问题。\p"
"至少有1只宝可梦\n"
"携带着道具。\p"
"很遗憾，在金字塔里得到的道具\n"
"是不能带出去的。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:646
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_HeldItemsMovedToBag"
msgid ""
"All items held by your POKéMON will be\n"
"moved to your BATTLE BAG, {PLAYER}.$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}，你的宝可梦携带的\n"
"所有道具都会被放进对战背包。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:650
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_BagCannotHoldPickItemsToKeep"
msgid ""
"The BATTLE BAG cannot hold all your\n"
"items, I'm sorry to say.\p"
"Please pick the items you'll keep in the\n"
"BATTLE BAG, and with your POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"很遗憾，对战背包\n"
"装不下你所有的道具。\p"
"请选出要留在对战背包里\n"
"和让宝可梦携带的道具。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:656
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_LeastOneMonHoldingItem"
msgid ""
"At least one POKéMON is still\n"
"holding an item.$"
msgstr ""
"至少还有1只宝可梦\n"
"携带着道具。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:660
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_PickItemsToKeep"
msgid ""
"Please pick the items you'll keep in the\n"
"BATTLE BAG, and with your POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"请选出要留在对战背包里\n"
"和让宝可梦携带的道具。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:665
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_ReturnedEverythingMonsHeld"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} returned everything that\n"
"the POKéMON held.$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}交还了\n"
"宝可梦携带的所有道具。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:669
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_UsedBattleBagWillBeKept"
msgid ""
"The BATTLE BAG you used will be kept\n"
"in readiness for your next challenge.\p"
"{PLAYER} turned the BATTLE BAG over\n"
"for the BAG's return.$"
msgstr ""
"你用过的对战背包会被保管起来，\n"
"供你下次挑战时使用。\p"
"{PLAYER}交出对战背包，\n"
"拿回了自己的背包。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:675
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_RecordResultsWait"
msgid ""
"I must record your results.\n"
"Please wait.$"
msgstr ""
"我要记录你的成绩。\n"
"请稍候。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:680
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_ForConqueringPyramidTakeThis"
msgid ""
"As a memento for conquering\n"
"the BATTLE PYRAMID, please take this.$"
msgstr ""
"作为征服对战金字塔的纪念，\n"
"请收下这个。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:685
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_ReceivedPrizeItem"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} received the prize\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}得到了奖品\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:690
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_BagIsFull"
msgid ""
"…Ah…\n"
"Your BAG appears to be filled.\p"
"Please return after you've organized\n"
"your BAG's contents.$"
msgstr ""
"……啊……\n"
"你的背包好像满了。\p"
"请整理好背包里的东西\n"
"再回来吧。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:696
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_DisappointingHereIsBag"
msgid ""
"How disappointing for you…\p"
"Here is the BAG we've been holding\n"
"for you.\p"
"{PLAYER} got the BAG back.$"
msgstr ""
"真是遗憾……\p"
"这是我们替你保管的背包。\p"
"{PLAYER}拿回了背包。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:702
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_LookForwardToNextChallenge"
msgid ""
"We look forward to your\n"
"next challenge!$"
msgstr "我们期待你的下次挑战！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:707
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_HereIsPrize"
msgid ""
"We have been looking forward to\n"
"your arrival!\p"
"Here is your prize for conquering\n"
"the PYRAMID.$"
msgstr ""
"我们一直在期待你的到来！\p"
"这是你征服金字塔的奖品。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:713
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_TellYouWhatMisfortunesAwait"
msgid ""
"Welcome…\p"
"I shall be pleased to tell you what\n"
"misfortunes await in the PYRAMID…$"
msgstr ""
"欢迎……\p"
"我很乐意告诉你，\n"
"金字塔里有什么样的厄运在等着你……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:718
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_Aah"
msgid ""
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … …\p"
"… … … … … …\n"
"Aah!$"
msgstr ""
"…… …… …… …… …… ……\n"
"…… …… …… …… …… ……\p"
"…… …… …… …… …… ……\n"
"啊！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:724
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_HintParalysis"
msgid ""
"I see a shower of sparks…\p"
"…And in it, I see your POKéMON\n"
"struggling with paralysis…$"
msgstr ""
"我看到了四溅的火花……\p"
"……在那里面，我看到你的宝可梦\n"
"正因麻痹而苦苦挣扎……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:729
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_HintPoison"
msgid ""
"I see poison…\p"
"…And, I see your POKéMON suffering\n"
"from the effects of poison…$"
msgstr ""
"我看到了毒……\p"
"……然后，我看到你的宝可梦\n"
"正受着中毒的折磨……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:734
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_HintBurn"
msgid ""
"I see bright red flames…\p"
"…And, I see your POKéMON suffering\n"
"from burns…$"
msgstr ""
"我看到了鲜红的火焰……\p"
"……然后，我看到你的宝可梦\n"
"正受着灼伤的折磨……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:739
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_HintPPWaste"
msgid ""
"I sense the tremendous pressure of\n"
"unrequited anger…\p"
"It is a curse…\p"
"…And, I see your POKéMON drained of\n"
"Power Points and having no recourse\l"
"but to use STRUGGLE…$"
msgstr ""
"我感觉到了无处发泄的愤怒\n"
"所带来的巨大压力……\p"
"那是一种诅咒……\p"
"……然后，我看到你的宝可梦\n"
"招式的PP被耗尽，\l"
"除了挣扎以外别无他法……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:747
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_HintLevitate"
msgid ""
"I see POKéMON loftily airborne…\p"
"…And, I see your POKéMON frustrated\n"
"by powerless GROUND-type moves…$"
msgstr ""
"我看到了高高飘浮在空中的宝可梦……\p"
"……然后，我看到你的宝可梦\n"
"因地面属性招式无效而苦恼……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:752
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_HintTrapAbility"
msgid ""
"I sense terrific energy rising from\n"
"the ground below…\p"
"…And, I see your POKéMON unable to\n"
"escape the power's clutches…$"
msgstr ""
"我感觉到有巨大的能量\n"
"从地底升起……\p"
"……然后，我看到你的宝可梦\n"
"无法逃脱那股力量的束缚……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:758
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_HintIce"
msgid ""
"I see ICE-type POKéMON…\p"
"…And, I see your POKéMON fighting\n"
"the freezing effects of ice…$"
msgstr ""
"我看到了冰属性的宝可梦……\p"
"……然后，我看到你的宝可梦\n"
"正在和冰冻的效果作斗争……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:763
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_HintExplosion"
msgid ""
"I see a flurry of moves that imperil\n"
"the user…\p"
"…And, I see your POKéMON falling\n"
"to them…$"
msgstr ""
"我看到了一连串\n"
"会让使用者陷入危险的招式……\p"
"……然后，我看到你的宝可梦\n"
"被那些招式打倒……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:769
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_HintPsychic"
msgid ""
"I see PSYCHIC-type POKéMON…\p"
"…And, I see your POKéMON in torment\n"
"from PSYCHIC moves…$"
msgstr ""
"我看到了超能力属性的宝可梦……\p"
"……然后，我看到你的宝可梦\n"
"正受着超能力招式的折磨……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:774
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_HintRock"
msgid ""
"I see ROCK-type POKéMON…\p"
"…And, I see your POKéMON suffering\n"
"from ROCK moves…$"
msgstr ""
"我看到了岩石属性的宝可梦……\p"
"……然后，我看到你的宝可梦\n"
"正受着岩石招式的折磨……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:779
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_HintFighting"
msgid ""
"I see FIGHTING-type POKéMON…\p"
"…And, I see your POKéMON pummeled\n"
"by FIGHTING moves…$"
msgstr ""
"我看到了格斗属性的宝可梦……\p"
"……然后，我看到你的宝可梦\n"
"正被格斗招式痛击……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:784
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_HintWeather"
msgid ""
"RAIN DANCE… SUNNY DAY…\n"
"SANDSTORM… HAIL…\p"
"I see POKéMON that become stronger\n"
"with the weather…\p"
"…And, I see your POKéMON confounded\n"
"by different types of moves…$"
msgstr ""
"求雨……大晴天……\n"
"沙暴……冰雹……\p"
"我看到了会随着天气\n"
"变强的宝可梦……\p"
"……然后，我看到你的宝可梦\n"
"被各种属性的招式弄得手足无措……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:792
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_HintBug"
msgid ""
"I see BUG-type POKéMON…\p"
"…And, I see your POKéMON suffering\n"
"from different kinds of attacks…$"
msgstr ""
"我看到了虫属性的宝可梦……\p"
"……然后，我看到你的宝可梦\n"
"正受着各种攻击的折磨……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:797
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_HintDark"
msgid ""
"I see DARK-type POKéMON…\p"
"…And, I see your POKéMON suffering\n"
"from DARK-type moves…$"
msgstr ""
"我看到了恶属性的宝可梦……\p"
"……然后，我看到你的宝可梦\n"
"正受着恶属性招式的折磨……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:802
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_HintWater"
msgid ""
