"…And, I see your POKéMON suffering\n"
"from WATER-type moves…$"
msgstr ""
"我看到了水属性的宝可梦……\p"
"……然后，我看到你的宝可梦\n"
"正受着水属性招式的折磨……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:807
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_HintGhost"
msgid ""
"I see GHOST-type POKéMON…\p"
"…And, I see your POKéMON suffering\n"
"from GHOST-type moves…$"
msgstr ""
"我看到了幽灵属性的宝可梦……\p"
"……然后，我看到你的宝可梦\n"
"正受着幽灵属性招式的折磨……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:812
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_HintSteel"
msgid ""
"I see STEEL-type POKéMON…\p"
"…And, I see your POKéMON suffering\n"
"from enormously powerful moves…$"
msgstr ""
"我看到了钢属性的宝可梦……\p"
"……然后，我看到你的宝可梦\n"
"正受着威力巨大的招式的折磨……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:817
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_HintFlyingDragon"
msgid ""
"I see flying POKéMON…\p"
"…And, I see your POKéMON suffering\n"
"from enormously powerful moves…$"
msgstr ""
"我看到了飞翔的宝可梦……\p"
"……然后，我看到你的宝可梦\n"
"正受着威力巨大的招式的折磨……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:822
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_HintStoneEvolve"
msgid ""
"I see those that have evolved from\n"
"the power of stones…\p"
"I also sense fire, water,\n"
"and electricity…\p"
"…And, I see your POKéMON suffering\n"
"from those three powers…$"
msgstr ""
"我看到了借助石头的力量\n"
"进化的宝可梦……\p"
"我还感觉到了火、水\n"
"和电……\p"
"……然后，我看到你的宝可梦\n"
"正受着那三种力量的折磨……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:830
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_HintNormal"
msgid ""
"I see NORMAL-type POKéMON…\p"
"…And, I see your POKéMON suffering\n"
"from enormously powerful moves…$"
msgstr ""
"我看到了一般属性的宝可梦……\p"
"……然后，我看到你的宝可梦\n"
"正受着威力巨大的招式的折磨……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:835
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_BelieveMyFortunesOrNot"
msgid ""
"Whether you believe my fortunes\n"
"or not, the choice is yours…\p"
"The future can be changed anytime…\n"
"I wish you safe passage…$"
msgstr ""
"信不信我的占卜，\n"
"由你自己决定……\p"
"未来随时都可以改变……\n"
"祝你一路平安……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:841
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_TrainersNoticeRunning"
msgid ""
"Did you know?\p"
"If you run fast, TRAINERS may notice\n"
"and come after you for a battle.\p"
"So, if you want to avoid TRAINERS,\n"
"don't catch their eyes, but sneak\l"
"cautiously and quietly past them.$"
msgstr ""
"你知道吗？\p"
"如果你跑得太快，训练家可能会\n"
"注意到你，追过来和你对战。\p"
"所以，如果你想避开训练家，\n"
"就别引起他们的注意，\l"
"小心翼翼地悄悄走过去。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:849
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_LostLotOfItems"
msgid ""
"Awaaaaaaarrrrgh!\p"
"I had a whole lot of items, but I lost\n"
"them all when I lost!\p"
"Awaaaaaaarrrrgh!$"
msgstr ""
"呜哇啊啊啊啊啊啊！\p"
"我本来有好多道具，\n"
"可是输了以后全都没了！\p"
"呜哇啊啊啊啊啊啊！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:855
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_YouveDefeatedPyramidKing"
msgid ""
"Welcome back!\n"
"You've done the unthinkable!\p"
"You've defeated the PYRAMID KING\n"
"and conquered the BATTLE PYRAMID!$"
msgstr ""
"欢迎回来！\n"
"你做到了难以想象的事！\p"
"你打败了金字塔之王，\n"
"征服了对战金字塔！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:861
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_GiveYouTheseBattlePoints"
msgid ""
"Young explorer!\n"
"In commendation of your courage,\l"
"we give you these Battle Point(s)!$"
msgstr ""
"年轻的探险家！\n"
"为了表彰你的勇气，\l"
"我们将这些对战点数送给你！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:866
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_RulesAreListed"
msgid "The Battle Quest rules are listed.$"
msgstr "上面列着对战探险的规则。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:869
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_ReadWhichHeading"
msgid "Which heading do you want to read?$"
msgstr "你要阅读哪一项？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:872
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_ExplainMonRules"
msgid ""
"When the PYRAMID is conquered,\n"
"the wild POKéMON that appear in it\l"
"are replaced by different kinds.\p"
"Explore, observe, and learn what kinds\n"
"of wild POKéMON you may encounter.$"
msgstr ""
"金字塔被征服之后，\n"
"里面出现的野生宝可梦\l"
"会换成别的种类。\p"
"去探索、观察，了解\n"
"你可能会遇到哪些野生宝可梦吧。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:879
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_ExplainTrainerRules"
msgid ""
"TRAINERS are lying in wait for you\n"
"inside the PYRAMID.\p"
"On each floor, there are up to\n"
"eight TRAINERS.\p"
"When you defeat a TRAINER, you will\n"
"get a helpful hint for your adventure.$"
msgstr ""
"金字塔里\n"
"有训练家在等着你。\p"
"每一层最多\n"
"有8位训练家。\p"
"打败训练家后，\n"
"你会得到对探险有帮助的提示。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:887
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_ExplainMazeRules"
msgid ""
"The mazes in the PYRAMID rearrange\n"
"themselves every time you enter it.\p"
"The mazes are poorly lit.\n"
"You must advance with caution.\p"
"The light grows brighter whenever you\n"
"defeat a wild POKéMON or a TRAINER.$"
msgstr ""
"每次进入金字塔，\n"
"里面的迷宫都会重新排列。\p"
"迷宫里光线昏暗。\n"
"你必须小心前进。\p"
"每当你打败野生宝可梦\n"
"或训练家，光线就会变亮。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby/scripts.inc:895
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_ExplainBagRules"
msgid ""
"The BATTLE BAG serves as your BAG\n"
"while in the PYRAMID.\p"
"There are two separate BATTLE BAGS--\n"
"one each for the Level 50 and\l"
"Open Level adventures.\p"
"They each can hold up to 99 pieces\n"
"of ten kinds of items.\p"
"The contents of the BATTLE BAG are\n"
"lost if you fail in your quest.$"
msgstr ""
"在金字塔里，\n"
"对战背包就是你的背包。\p"
"对战背包有两个，\n"
"分别用于Lv.50和\l"
"自由等级的探险。\p"
"每个背包可以装10种道具，\n"
"每种最多99个。\p"
"如果探险失败，\n"
"对战背包里的东西就会消失。$"
